{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat goats one battle at a time and expand your build after every fight. Choose new gear, experiment with its attributes, and uncover powerful combinations and synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wild Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual wield daggers, carry massive shields, or wield magic wands - you choose. If you prefer chaos, try builds like Jesus Crits, French Vampire, or the One-Shot Baguette.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attribute Manipulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece of gear holds different attributes that can be combined, counted, multiplied, changed, and used to create powerful combos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run makes you stronger. Unlock new gear, expand your pool of items, and create crazier and more powerful builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Steam leaderboards by pushing your builds further every run. Optimize your gear, discover stronger synergies, and compete with players worldwide.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601690?t=1773503112","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601690?t=1773503112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/fff0a04ff43233bdb292432250a28eb6649c69ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773503112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601690/fff0a04ff43233bdb292432250a28eb6649c69ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773503112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","